  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>q</mi></math> and <math><mi>r</mi></math> are three logical statements then the truth value of the statement <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>∧</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>∨</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, where&nbsp;<math><mi>p</mi></math> is true, is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "1stlc",
      "text": "True if <math><mi>q</mi></math> is true",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "RdvFM",
      "text": "False if <math><mi>q</mi></math> is true",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "TCzlD",
      "text": "True if <math><mi>q</mi></math> is false",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "yGhoF",
      "text": "False if <math><mi>q</mi></math> is false",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Clearly, if <math><mi>q</mi></math> is False, <math><mi>p</mi></math> is True, then <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>∧</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is True<br />Hence,&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>∧</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>∨</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is True&nbsp;irrespective of <math><mi>r</mi></math>",
    "image": null
  },
